ASoC: qcom: audioreach: register and calibrate vendor CAPI modules from firmware

AMDB registration (qcom/audioreach/amdb-modules.bin) before the first graph opens and
APM_CMD_SET_CFG calibration (qcom/audioreach/module-<id>.bin) for 0x17xxxxxx modules, for the
TFA9873 speaker protection (Goodix tfadsp) on the Nothing Phone (3a). Applies on top of the
Nura patch.
